%% Offering state machine in contracts/offering (Status enum) and the outcome record
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: create_offering (admin)
  Open --> Open: subscribe (approved investor),<br/>shares minted
  Open --> Closed: subscribe reaches the cap
  Open --> Refunding: start_refunds (admin),<br/>after the deadline, cap not reached
  Closed --> Funded: fund (admin),<br/>escrow to SPV treasury
  Funded --> Distributing: deposit_distribution (treasury),<br/>outcome code 1-5
  Distributing --> Distributing: redeem (investor),<br/>shares burned
  Refunding --> Refunding: refund (investor),<br/>shares burned
  Distributing --> Recorded: record_outcome Repaid (codes 1-2)<br/>or InsuredLoss (code 4), recorder
  Refunding --> Recorded: record_outcome Refunded, recorder
  Recorded --> [*]: sweep_surplus once all redeemed,<br/>then transfer_share_admin at close
  note right of Recorded
    Recorded is not a Status value: the outcome
    record is written once, beside the offering.
  end note
